<title>UK: Lloyds advises no action on Gehe bid.</title>
<headline>Lloyds advises no action on Gehe bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of bid target Lloyds Chemists plc said on Tuesday that it noted today's announcement from German drug wholesaler Gehe AG that it planned a new cash bid for the British company and advised its own shareholders to take no action in response.</p>
</text>
